record jpegxl-rs.observation.phase5-quality-policy-screen-2026-08-11/6 : observation {
    title "Active EPF improves all twelve cells, but only two meet the cjxl goal"
    state superseded
    scope [
        path "JPXL/crates/jpxl-cli/src/main.rs",
        path "JPXL/crates/jpxl-encode-policy/src/field.rs",
        path "JPXL/crates/jpxl-encode-policy/src/lib.rs",
        path "JPXL/crates/jpxl-encode-policy/src/request.rs",
        path "JPXL/crates/jpxl-encode-policy/tests/rate_loop.rs",
        path "JPXL/crates/jpxl-encode-policy/tests/vardct_oracle.rs",
        path "test-set/**"
    ]
    statement """
        Phase 5G promoted AQ Off, quant_lf 8, and no LF-fill for target-rate requests after six-scene matched-rate testing improved Butteraugli in all twelve cells by 7.6% to 34.2%. Phase 5H then tested quant_lf 4 across the same matrix: it split six wins and six losses; quant_lf 2 improved Butteraugli in a two-scene direction screen but caused material low-rate SSIM loss, so quant_lf 8 remains the global default and the mixed result points toward content-adaptive LF/HF allocation. Phase 5I corrected the prior no-op EPF screen by emitting uniform Sharpness 7 with one EPF step. Independent activation tests proved decoded pixels change and both djxl and jxl-oxide accept the stream. At matched achieved rate, active EPF improved Butteraugli by 0.7% to 11.4%, RMSE, and BA pnorm3 in every one of the twelve representative cells; SSIM improved in eleven and regressed only 0.0351 in the remaining cell. Target-rate defaults now include active EPF, while fixed-quantizer defaults remain restoration-off. The untouched CLI output is byte-identical to the screened candidate. Against the existing equal-rate cjxl effort-7 anchors, the active policy is within 20% Butteraugli on two of twelve cells and remains 23.8% to 78.1% worse on the other ten, so the user goal is not complete. Raw commands and tables are in .agent/scratch/phase5g-corpus-summary-2026-08-11.md, .agent/scratch/phase5h-quantlf-tail-2026-08-11.md, and .agent/scratch/phase5i-active-epf-2026-08-11.md.
        """
    observed_at git:25213f6821b695e5b60a8d34c785a09aed9ee327
    method command
    watches [
        "JPXL/crates/jpxl-encode-policy/src/field.rs",
